<title>MALAWI: SOCCER-ZAMBIA BEAT MALAWI 2-0 IN NATIONS CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ZAMBIA BEAT MALAWI 2-0 IN NATIONS CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>BLANTYRE 1997-01-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zambia beat Malawi 2-0 (halftime</p>
<p>1-0) in an African Nations Cup group 7 first-leg qualifier on</p>
<p>Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Elia Tana 40, Andrew Tembo 83</p>
<p>Attendance: 40,000</p>
</text>
